# Black (parent console 0): attendant -> save -> Union Room -> walk to White -> talk -> menu
@repeat A every 40 until rgb bot 10 10 100 8 113 209 241 20 timeout 4000
@until rgb bot 10 65 100 8 105 200 234 20 timeout 4000
@log shimmer is in the room
@wait 60
@press UP hold 48 gap 4
@press RIGHT hold 32 gap 4
@press UP hold 4 gap 30
@press UP hold 16 gap 30
@press A hold 4 gap 30
@until !rgb top 240 178 8 3 251 251 251 60 & rgb top 10 150 200 12 232 231 232 20 timeout 900
@press A hold 4 gap 10
@until rgb top 5 5 50 40 223 222 223 15 timeout 900
@log menu open
@press DOWN hold 4 gap 20
@press DOWN hold 4 gap 20
@press A hold 4 gap 60
@log trade requested
@repeat A every 40 until rgb top 0 0 120 14 73 73 73 10 & rgb bot 4 10 120 14 208 206 208 15 timeout 20000
@log trade screen
@wait 120
@press T:108:60 hold 6 gap 200
@press T:108:36 hold 6 gap 200
@press T:200:157 hold 6 gap 400
@press T:217:179 hold 6 gap 500
@press T:200:55 hold 6 gap 300
@log offered
# The game stays in the trade interface after an exchange; it does not return to the Union Room.
# Stop sending A (which can initiate a second offer) and wait for the selection panel again.
@wait 120
@until rgb top 0 0 120 14 73 73 73 10 & rgb bot 4 10 120 14 208 206 208 15 timeout 9000
@log returned to trade selection
